  <dsc><c id="8385bd8e5160ee6946ceb885c0d03ba3" level="series"><did><unittitle>Chronological files</unittitle><unitid>1</unitid><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/1083361</unitid><physdesc altrender="whole"><extent altrender="materialtype spaceoccupied">0.76 Cubic Feet</extent><extent altrender="carrier">About 2 LTR size Hollinger boxes</extent></physdesc><unitdate datechar="creation" normal="1987/1991" type="inclusive">1987-1991</unitdate></did><scopecontent id="c47e6b9132d0e0db4dbb4d2705b8bf81"><head>Scope and Contents</head><p>Series contains a set of chronological files Ford Foundation staff member Chika A. Iritani created to organize her correspondence. Most files primarily consist of correspondence addressed from Iritani to grantees and other Ford staff members. However, the 1987-1990 Chronological file (Box 2, Folders 8-10) also includes a significant amount of correspondence addressed to Iritani. Correspondence in that file includes many faxes and telegrams and originates from a more extensive period of time than what is covered by the other chronological files.  </p><p>
Correspondence in the series generally regards the receipt of grant reports, closeouts of grants, purchase orders, and program reviews among other grants administration and program management activities. </p><p>
Series continues the run of Iritani chronological files started in Series IV of the Ford Foundation records, Developing Countries Program, Program Staff Files (FA528) collection.</p></scopecontent><c id="8ab8a55eab6fc00978b826f9ec7aa196" level="file"><did><unittitle>Chronological file</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/1083363</unitid><unitdate datechar="creation" normal="1988/1988">1988</unitdate><container altrender="Letter Document Box" id="48b913c02bffe56cf9b5e33260bb64e9" label="mixed materials [A0000000017479]" type="box">1</container><container id="907f2657f802988fcc2f8a7b6af6ae19" parent="48b913c02bffe56cf9b5e33260bb64e9" type="folder">1-2</container></did></c><c id="c05e71eeaa08b9e613f40ad53fee4e64" level="file"><did><unittitle>Chronological file</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/1083364</unitid><unitdate datechar="creation" normal="1988/1989" type="inclusive">1988-1989</unitdate><container altrender="Letter Document Box" id="86fc3df078fce6cb31f637c2ee242f50" label="mixed materials [A0000000017479]" type="box">1</container><container id="abc287b6f515f0366582843486b1223f" parent="86fc3df078fce6cb31f637c2ee242f50" type="folder">3-5</container></did></c><c id="f672be191552bdd69cf97aee5fc10124" level="file"><did><unittitle>Chronological file</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/1083366</unitid><unitdate datechar="creation" normal="1990/1990">1990</unitdate><container altrender="Letter Document Box" id="35f727d71ecce360cb6cf924b947a96a" label="mixed materials [A0000000017479]" type="box">1</container><container id="79919db4ca7861ea0a7070c046c1e927" parent="35f727d71ecce360cb6cf924b947a96a" type="folder">6-7</container></did></c><c id="dc4c3c7bd898cbebad983f6beb401db0" level="file"><did><unittitle>Chronological file</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/1083368</unitid><unitdate datechar="creation" normal="1987/1990" type="inclus